      "id": "reading",
      "className": "panel",
      "type": "rich",
      "html": "<span class=\"number\">INPUT · 4 MIN</span><h2>Read, listen to your own voice, and notice</h2><p class=\"instruction\">Read once for meaning. Then read aloud; on the second pass, notice how the speaker uses whole phrases.</p><div class=\"reading\">Next week, I'm going to start a new project. I plan to meet the client on Tuesday to understand the main problem. We're meeting our designer on Wednesday morning. My goal is to make the first page simple and useful. By Friday, I want to send the first design to the client. We learned that clear instructions save time, so I will share notes after each meeting. The main reason is that everyone needs the same information. After that, we can agree what to build first. I think a small start will help us learn quickly.</div>"
    },
