    {
      "id": "conversation",
      "className": "panel",
      "type": "rich",
      "html": "<span class=\"number\">CONVERSATION · 3 MIN</span><h2>A real work conversation</h2><p class=\"instruction\">Practise with a partner, or take both roles aloud. Your partner is a coworker. Open one question, answer it, then continue. Khi luyện cùng Codex, yêu cầu đóng vai đồng nghiệp và hỏi từng câu; trang này không có AI trò chuyện trực tiếp.</p><details class=\"conversation-turn\"><summary>Colleague · question 1</summary><p>What did you finish recently?</p></details><details class=\"conversation-turn\"><summary>Colleague · question 2</summary><p>What happened during the work?</p></details><details class=\"conversation-turn\"><summary>Colleague · question 3</summary><p>What did you learn?</p></details><details class=\"conversation-turn\"><summary>Colleague · question 4</summary><p>What are you planning next?</p></details><p class=\"instruction\">After 4 exchanges, choose at most 3 useful corrections. Say the improved sentences once more.</p>"
    },
